I arrive at my apartment building.
I see my neighbor Asha.
She is walking with her dog.
The dog's name is Moti.
Moti sees me and runs towards me.
He is very happy.
I laugh and pet him.
"Hello Moti!" I say.
"How are you?"
"Hello Asha."
Asha says, "Hello Maya."
"Are you coming from the office now?"
"Yes, I am returning from the office," I say.
"The evening weather is very pleasant."
Asha says, "Yes, a cool breeze is blowing."
"That is why Moti is playing here."
"Maya, what are you cooking for dinner?" she asks.
"I am cooking spinach and rice," I say.
"I am cooking dal and roti," Asha says.
Asha is very kind.
Mumbai is my home now.
